### Smart Loan Tracker API - Analytics Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@authToken = your-auth-token-here

### Get Overall Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Monthly Breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/monthly?month=2024-11
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Yearly Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/yearly?year=2024
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Category Breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

